#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:2
msgid "从RNN到注意力：一个思想的跳跃"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`rnn-basics` 揭示了 RNN 的困境：$\\mathbf{h}_t$ 只能通过 $\\mathbf{h}_{t-1}$ "
"间接获取前序信息。{doc}`lstm` 用门控机制为梯度开辟了高速公路，但信息仍是串行传递的——经过几十个 $\\mathbf{f}_t "
"\\odot \\mathbf{c}_{t-1}$ 操作后，$\\mathbf{h}_1$ 的信息在 $\\mathbf{c}_{100}$ "
"中终究会衰减。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**关键问题**：如果 $\\mathbf{h}_t$ 能直接看到 $\\mathbf{h}_1, \\mathbf{h}_2, ..., "
"\\mathbf{h}_{t-1}$ 全部历史，而不只是 $\\mathbf{h}_{t-1}$，会怎么样？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:9
msgid "直觉跳跃：从\"传话\"到\"查档案\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:11
msgid "两个处理模式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md
msgid "RNN的传话模式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md
msgid "注意力的查档模式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md
msgid "信息获取"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md
msgid "只听上一个人说"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md
msgid "直接查阅所有前序记录"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md
msgid "信息质量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md
msgid "逐次衰减"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md
msgid "不受距离影响"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md
#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:215
msgid "并行性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md
msgid "串行，$t$ 步等 $t-1$ 步完成"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md
msgid "所有步骤可同时计算"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:19
msgid "RNN 就像传话游戏：第100个人想知道第10个人说了什么，只能通过中间90个人的转述。每转述一次，信息就损失一点。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:21
msgid "注意力的做法完全不同：**第100个人能看到所有人的\"原始发言记录\"，然后自己判断哪些发言对当前理解最重要**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:24
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**这不是一个全新的想法**。{ref}`inductive-bias` 告诉我们，好的架构把对任务结构的理解内置到设计中。RNN "
"的归纳偏置是\"时序因果性\"——$t$ 时刻只能依赖 $< t$ "
"的信息。注意力保留了这一偏置，但改变了信息的传递方式：不再通过循环连接一步步传递，而是直接建立全局连接。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:26
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"如果你学过 {ref}`res-net`，会发现这和残差网络的思想完全一致——**用一条捷径绕开衰减路径**。ResNet "
"的跳跃连接让梯度在**深度方向**绕过非线性层直传；注意力让信息在**时间方向**绕过中间步骤直达。两者的核心洞察是同一个：**不让信号被迫穿过每一次变换，给它一条直接通路**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:30
msgid "数学推导：因果注意力的自然诞生"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:32
msgid ""
"我们要解决的问题：在时刻 $t$，给定所有前序隐状态 $\\{\\mathbf{h}_1, \\mathbf{h}_2, ..., "
"\\mathbf{h}_{t-1}\\}$（以及当前输入的信息），如何计算出当前的最佳表示？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:34
msgid "步骤一：衡量\"相关性\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:36
msgid "首先需要一个机制来判断哪些前序状态对当前时刻重要。最自然的方式是用**相似度**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:38
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"s_{t,i} = \\text{score}(\\mathbf{h}_t, \\mathbf{h}_i), \\quad i < t\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:42
msgid "最简单的相似度是点积："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:44
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"s_{t,i} = \\mathbf{h}_t \\cdot \\mathbf{h}_i\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:48
#, python-brace-format
msgid "如果 $\\mathbf{h}_t$ 和 $\\mathbf{h}_i$ 方向相似，点积大；方向相反，点积小（甚至为负）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:50
msgid "步骤二：归一化为权重"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:52
msgid "将相似度分数用 Softmax 转为概率分布（权重）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:54
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\alpha_{t,i} = \\frac{\\exp(s_{t,i})}{\\sum_{j=1}^{t-1} \\exp(s_{t,j})},"
" \\quad i < t\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\alpha_{t,i}$ 表示\"在理解第 $t$ 步时，第 $i$ 步的信息有多重要\"。所有权重之和为 1。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:60
msgid "步骤三：加权聚合"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:62
msgid "用这些权重对前序状态加权求和："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:64
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{c}_t = \\sum_{i=1}^{t-1} \\alpha_{t,i} \\cdot \\mathbf{h}_i\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:68
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\mathbf{c}_t$ 称为 **上下文向量（context "
"vector）**——它是所有前序信息的\"加权摘要\"，权重由当前需求动态决定。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:70
msgid "这就是因果注意力"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:73
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{CausalAttention}(\\mathbf{h}_t, "
"\\{\\mathbf{h}_1...\\mathbf{h}_{t-1}\\}) = \\sum_{i=1}^{t-1} "
"\\text{softmax}(\\mathbf{h}_t \\cdot \\mathbf{h}_i) \\cdot \\mathbf{h}_i"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:77
msgid "\"因果\"指的是：$t$ 时刻只能看到过去（$i < t$），不能看到未来。这是序列建模的自然约束——你不能用还没说出的话来理解当前词。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:81
msgid "步骤四：分离\"查询\"和\"被查询\"——引入可学习的投影"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:83
#, python-brace-format
msgid "步骤三的公式已经能工作，但有一个微妙的局限。在整个序列的计算中，**同一个隐状态向量 $\\mathbf{h}$** 会被迫扮演三个不同的角色："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:85
#, python-brace-format
msgid "当它是当前时刻的查询出发点时（$\\mathbf{h}_t$），它需要表达\"**我在找什么？**\"（Query）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:86
#, python-brace-format
msgid "当它是被查询的历史记录时（$\\mathbf{h}_i$），它需要表达\"**我有什么特征可以被匹配？**\"（Key）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:87
#, python-brace-format
msgid "当它被选中并参与聚合时（$\\mathbf{h}_i$），它还需要表达\"**我能提供什么具体信息？**\"（Value）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:89
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"在步骤三的公式 $\\mathbf{c}_t = \\sum_{i=1}^{t-1} \\text{softmax}(\\mathbf{h}_t "
"\\cdot \\mathbf{h}_i) \\cdot \\mathbf{h}_i$ 中，这种冲突直接体现在了 "
"**$\\mathbf{h}_i$ 出现了两次**：一次在点积中充当 Key，一次在加权求和中充当 "
"Value。同一个向量必须同时回答\"我是什么\"和\"我能提供什么\"——这两个目标可能完全不同。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:92
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**一个具体的例子**：假设 $\\mathbf{h}_2$ "
"是名词\"猫\"的表示。当未来的动词\"跑\"（$\\mathbf{h}_5$）来查询它时："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:93
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"作为 **Key**：$\\mathbf{h}_2$ 需要暴露\"我是名词、生物、可以做主语\"的索引特征，以便和 $\\mathbf{h}_5$"
" 的查询向量匹配"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:94
#, python-brace-format
msgid "作为 **Value**：$\\mathbf{h}_2$ 需要提供\"猫\"的完整语义信息，以便聚合到上下文中"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:96
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"如果 $\\mathbf{h}_2$ "
"必须用同一套数值同时满足\"做索引标签\"和\"做内容载体\"两个目标，表达力会严重受限——它无法针对不同职能做专门的优化。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:99
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"解决方案很自然：**给每个向量三个可学习的投影**，让它能根据\"当前扮演什么角色\"来调整自己的表达 "
"{cite}`vaswani2017attention`："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:101
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Query $\\mathbf{q}_t = \\mathbf{W}_q \\mathbf{h}_t$**（查询）：从当前时刻出发的检索需求"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:102
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Key $\\mathbf{k}_i = \\mathbf{W}_k \\mathbf{h}_i$**（键）：暴露自己供别人检索的特征"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:103
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Value $\\mathbf{v}_i = \\mathbf{W}_v \\mathbf{h}_i$**（值）：实际被聚合的内容"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:105
msgid "对比步骤三的原始公式和推广后的公式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:107
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**原始**（$\\mathbf{h}_i$ 身兼 Key/Value 两职）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:109
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{c}_t = \\sum_{i=1}^{t-1} \\text{softmax}(\\mathbf{h}_t \\cdot "
"\\mathbf{h}_i) \\cdot \\mathbf{h}_i\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:113
msgid "**推广后**（Q/K/V 三个角色分离）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:115
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{c}_t = \\sum_{i=1}^{t-1} \\text{softmax}\\!\\left((\\mathbf{W}_q"
" \\mathbf{h}_t) \\cdot (\\mathbf{W}_k \\mathbf{h}_i)\\right) \\cdot "
"(\\mathbf{W}_v \\mathbf{h}_i) = \\sum_{i=1}^{t-1} "
"\\text{softmax}\\!\\left(\\mathbf{q}_t \\cdot \\mathbf{k}_i\\right) "
"\\cdot \\mathbf{v}_i\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:119
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"可以看到：如果 $\\mathbf{W}_q = \\mathbf{W}_k = \\mathbf{W}_v = "
"\\mathbf{I}$（单位矩阵），两式完全等价——步骤三的简单版本是步骤四的一个**特例**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:121
#, python-brace-format
msgid "除以 $\\sqrt{d_k}$，即："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:123
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{Attention}(\\mathbf{q}_t, \\mathbf{K}, \\mathbf{V}) = "
"\\sum_{i=1}^{t-1} \\text{softmax}\\!\\left(\\frac{\\mathbf{q}_t \\cdot "
"\\mathbf{k}_i}{\\sqrt{d_k}}\\right) \\cdot \\mathbf{v}_i\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:127
#, python-brace-format
msgid "为什么除以 $\\sqrt{d_k}$?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:130
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"当 Key 的维度 $d_k$ 很大时，点积 $\\mathbf{q} \\cdot \\mathbf{k}$ 的方差约为 "
"$d_k$。大点积值会让 Softmax 进入饱和区——大部分 $\\alpha$ 趋近于 0 或 1，梯度几乎为 0。除以 "
"$\\sqrt{d_k}$ 将方差缩放到 1，保持 Softmax 输出平滑、梯度健康。这被称为**缩放点积注意力（Scaled Dot-"
"Product Attention）**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:133
msgid "类比：图书馆检索"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:136
msgid "**Query**：你要找的问题（\"关于深度学习的书\"）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:137
msgid "**Key**：每本书的索引标签（书名、关键词）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:138
msgid "**Value**：书的内容"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:139
msgid "**过程**：用 Query 匹配 Key 得到每本书的相关性分数 → Softmax 归一化 → 基于权重从各书的 Value 中聚合信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:141
msgid "你最终得到的是所有相关书的\"加权摘要\"，而非一本书的全部内容。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/from-rnn-to-attention.md:144
